  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.models.DealerInfo\": {\n        \"summary\": \"A data model class that represents the information stored about an individual dealer. Contains dealer details including name, contact, address, email, and phone. Provides three constructors: a default no-argument constructor, a constructor accepting a name parameter, and a copy constructor for cloning DealerInfo objects. Key methods include: validate() which validates the dealer information (specifically the required name field) and returns validation errors as a JSON-formatted string or null if valid; standard getter and setter methods for all five fields (name, contact, address, email, phone). The class uses the Utility.validateStringField() helper method for validation and only the name field is mandatory.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/models/DealerInfo.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
